{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a5fe5cc96b43091c61e798141b14fcedc85b524daac1625a43e840bdf7d87a5f", "ja": "（今日の公演も、いよいよクライマックス。\nもうすぐ、桃子の出番だ……！）", "zh": "（今天的公演也终于到了高潮。\n桃子马上就要上场了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "2afc614e17a8c72b53630c910979c93a96fdc1afc450941859ecaec5b0faf9e9", "ja": "どうしたの、お兄ちゃん。緊張してるみたいだけど、\n気になることでもあった？", "zh": "怎么了，哥哥？看起来你很紧张，是有什么在意的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0120590f9616c1d429af0901064235287bba2c3bed01f1af9da4e7730b44e08d", "ja": "いや、そうじゃないんだけど。\nもうすぐ出番だと思ったら、なんだか……。", "zh": "不，不是那样的。\n一想到马上就该你出场了，不知怎么就……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "123f70653482c66d6d38886c4bbd94a72217acc76d9c9ddfffff317ad8773f41", "ja": "もう。これからステージに出る桃子より、\nお兄ちゃんの方が緊張してどうするの。", "zh": "真是的。明明马上就要上台的桃子都没你紧张，你这样可怎么办呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "70a3cabb297931f3d378655c6b56654346bf2ef8fb132ca371a2bd384c6853b6", "ja": "お兄ちゃんだって、桃子なら大丈夫って思ったから、\nこのステージを任せてくれたんでしょ？", "zh": "哥哥也是因为觉得桃子没问题，才把这个舞台交给桃子的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1005_p", "source_sha256": "32d549096a8334cdbebe5771cb09437aced89007c1e507aee8fa8c9dfdbf2bda", "ja": "はは、確かにそうだ。\n桃子は、あんまり緊張してないみたいだな？", "zh": "哈哈，确实是这样。桃子，你好像没怎么紧张嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "ecb24edf0d3a6e7b341adc6887c142766d6b080181afb1660b6d00931ccd6a7f", "ja": "それはやっぱり、経験……もだけど、\nさっきまで、みんなと話してたからかも。", "zh": "果然还是因为经验……不过，也可能是因为刚才一直在和大家聊天吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "d281ca2a38456e19741ae3fc5bba64669deb3aac56730c90e74e4ebcc7b51a67", "ja": "ここまでのステージ、すごく楽しかったし。\nその勢いを、桃子がつないでいかないとね。", "zh": "到目前为止的舞台都特别开心。所以，桃子也得把这股势头延续下去才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "989eab14e0145ff63e8d36f00c2cfc685aed84bcab2b4395d9b7765bac753b6f", "ja": "だから緊張なんてしてるヒマないんだよ。\nそれに、今日の主役は桃子なんだから。", "zh": "所以才没工夫紧张啊。\n而且，今天的主角可是桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "543b6a7a3e0647ae48621b0e3e8e29b6d6abeb9726c56d7d362c080a684857e2", "ja": "みんなの中で一番、楽しまないとね♪", "zh": "在大家当中，桃子一定要玩得最开心才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7ded3059f14be7cd1f728654a6424e950d1e0167d39aad665160ec3f15bc66d2", "ja": "そうだな。桃子の言う通りだ。", "zh": "是啊，桃子说得没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "a315ee2ce37fad82f24be473e0483c11d29542d9045d61d85deb9d1225c2cde7", "ja": "なんか、今日のお兄ちゃん、ちょっと頼りないね。\nまあ、たまにはいいけど。", "zh": "总觉得今天的哥哥有点靠不住呢。\n不过，偶尔这样也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "a319eaa32e4931d3827a2124ef1e258ce88c1a1325933b267fad13aba961f122", "ja": "だって、この後の桃子のステージを見たら、\n不安なんて吹き飛んじゃうんだから♪", "zh": "因为只要看过接下来桃子的舞台，\n什么不安都会一扫而空嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1013_p", "source_sha256": "02f99cd66206d1a0c286ff847ff28d60a0214bdb489647463fa56d297d730a45", "ja": "それは、期待していいって事か？", "zh": "也就是说，可以期待吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "bc2bcbc1cad8a1ed294a4066cc2df7aa7f98a26a9d5b763736cc9680672b7357", "ja": "もちろん！　というか、期待してくれなくちゃダメ！\n桃子はいつも全力だけど、今日の桃子はすごいよ。", "zh": "当然！不如说，你一定要期待才行！\n桃子一直都在全力以赴，但今天的桃子可是很厉害的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "87bc9b6d872478e0aa9181765915dbc81a7e1e79ca7115b920fb572f521d519b", "ja": "それに、お兄ちゃんは桃子のプロデューサーでしょ？", "zh": "而且，哥哥是桃子的制作人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "016fa72459c7a68708c434a599acf7aad746ca23b81c3cab50b5459460105fed", "ja": "今日のステージも最初から最後まで見て、\n本当にすごかったって、証明してもらわないとね♪", "zh": "今天的舞台也要从头到尾看完，\n让你证明桃子真的很厉害才行哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c048da5a6888c715e07b6aaf44d3a9ebb42d543b0666f5606db5ec7b61956161", "ja": "うん……そうだな！\n桃子の全力のステージは、見届けないとな！", "zh": "嗯……没错！桃子全力以赴的舞台，我可得亲眼见证到最后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "7acd48f7357003847696aebd2be6cd227000265c1fed50b21a4338d11d9a63f9", "ja": "うん！　お兄ちゃんはそうでなくちゃ。\n桃子はお兄ちゃんも、ファンのみんなも……。", "zh": "嗯！哥哥就该这样才对。\n桃子要让哥哥，还有粉丝们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "98810e097e801745a4bf4c4eca70adc818b8c1ed9d17dd2ddea06325ece199c9", "ja": "劇場のみんなだって、びっくりさせちゃうんだから！\n1秒も、見逃さないこと！　わかった？", "zh": "剧场里的大家也会大吃一惊的！连1秒都不许错过！明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0664_1020_p", "source_sha256": "1be9ecafa862050442f73ccda9ab1e3edecbdfdb8c0401ef3f5b9c685e682093", "ja": "（今の桃子は、かつてないほどに頼もしい。みんなの\n期待を背負って……最高のステージを、頼んだぞ！）", "zh": "（现在的桃子，比以往任何时候都更可靠。背负着大家的期待……拜托你了，去呈现最棒的舞台吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
